JOHN AKOMFRAH. A SPACE OF EMPATHY can be experienced at the SCHIRN KUNSTHALLE FRANKFURT until January 28. The immersive multi-screen installations by the acclaimed artist take a critical look at colonial history, global migration and the climate crisis. TIP! With your Re-Entry Ticket, you will receive a second free entry to the exhibition at a later date.
